# Inbox

#
# Module
#
ModuleInboxName = Inbox
ModuleInboxDesc = Webmail in Dolibarr: the mailboxes of the team, shared or personal, read and written next to your customers and your documents
ModuleInboxDescLong = Inbox is a webmail inside Dolibarr. Each user finds the mailboxes opened to them by the team (shared or personal, IMAP), reads, sorts, tags and assigns the mails, writes with templates and a full editor, and sends from the server of the mailbox. Beside each mail, Dolibarr: the thirdparty and the contact recognised, the linked proposals, orders and invoices, the notes of the team; a mail is linked to a piece or creates it in one click, and a sending can be recorded on it. Rights by mailbox (read, send, manage), journal of the actions, installable on a phone. Other modules plug into it through its hooks.

#
# Permissions
#
InboxRightMessageRead = Read a mail from its Message-ID
InboxRightWebmailUse = Use the webmail (only the mailboxes given to the user)
InboxRightAccountAdmin = Manage the mailboxes (servers, accesses, identities; does not give the reading of the mails)
Permission14193001 = Read a mail from its Message-ID
Permission14193002 = Use the webmail (only the mailboxes given to the user)
Permission14193003 = Manage the mailboxes (servers, accesses, identities; does not give the reading of the mails)

